TAMEV Micro MiniLM model integration

This release includes an adapter for the TAMEV Micro MiniLM model at revision
c1b95679390911748aad57f634bed70e5f87a084:

https://huggingface.co/Tamkimd/tamev-micro-minilm/tree/c1b95679390911748aad57f634bed70e5f87a084

The pinned model card declares Apache-2.0. Its exact LICENSE file is included
as TAMEV-MICRO-LICENSE. The base model identified by the card is
sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2.

The model weights, tokenizer, configuration, training data and exported ONNX
assets are fetched separately by the application; none are included in this
npm package. The project has checked asset revisions, file sizes, hashes and
runtime behavior. This notice does not make an independent legal determination
about training-data provenance or grant rights beyond the upstream license.
